  "observations": "Root ordered second reading: whole image and both actual supplied halves viewed before image-first receipt and text opening;35 fresh crops personally inspected, including upright manuscript19. All agreed/differing words, accents, mathematics, underlines, deletions, insertions and margin marks were checked. Two visible word-end divisions are restored. The live l in qu’il is resolved and the overlapping rounded old glyph is separately doubtful o|h. Two letter corrections in quasi-séparé are represented, retaining uncertainty about an old accent. The long marginal arrow has its short mid-shaft interruption reproduced. The question mark in the noetherian condition remains live; the upper and lower cancelled blocks retain their scope. The plain k(x), G-prime, complete tensor oval, sloping inequality bar, Aut subscript, and leftward limit arrow were verified. The two different noetherian spellings/spacings, Gn|On, old numbering layers, G-prime|l-prime prefix and final base-alphabet ambiguity remain. The edge fragment does not warrant inventing a separate preceding word under cancellation strokes. Manuscript19 and archive50 remain distinct. Eight doubts remain. No context or mathematical proof check was used.",
